WEBVTT

00:43:28.201 --> 00:43:32.507
then you'll be able
to leverage that later.

00:43:32.888 --> 00:43:35.749
And not in, like, a capitalistic,
opportunistic way,

00:43:35.773 --> 00:43:38.450
like, work together,

00:43:38.474 --> 00:43:40.521
because those things transcend companies.

00:43:40.545 --> 00:43:42.836
Whether it was a truly work relationship,

00:43:42.860 --> 00:43:44.851
perform, do well.

00:43:44.875 --> 00:43:47.550
I think too many people really feel

00:43:47.574 --> 00:43:50.715
like the work that they're doing
is, like, for the company.

00:43:50.739 --> 00:43:52.033
"I worked for the company."

00:43:52.057 --> 00:43:54.204
No, I think what most people
need to recognize

00:43:54.228 --> 00:43:55.778
is that you work for yourself,

00:43:55.802 --> 00:43:58.246
and your best investment is you,

00:43:58.270 --> 00:44:00.314
and what you leave behind
is the reputation